/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Eighth[8]- <-> Tenth[40]+ (record
goctad:E4@T26-, e = -1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wGoctadE4T26nHX` and `wGoctadE4T26nGX` (divided by `2
^ 29` and `2 ^ 25`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column;
the parts evaluate no word image. -/

